{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' openspec/changes/dispatch-test-coverage/mission/handoffs/task-1.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Task 1 Handoff: Parser Table Tests\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded inline unit coverage for `parse_codex_event` in `src/engine.rs`.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added a table-driven parser test covering the requested NDJSON cases:\n  - `thread.started`\n  - `item.started` for `tool_use`\n  - `item.started` for `agent_message`\n  - command execution start and completion\n  - `item.completed` for `agent_message`\n  - `item.completed` for generic `tool_use`\n  - file write and file read tool completions\n  - `turn.completed`\n  - `turn.failed`\n  - `error`\n  - non-JSON passthrough\n  - unknown JSON event type\n  - ignored `turn.started` and `item.updated` progress events\n  - empty line\n- Added focused field extraction tests for:\n  - session id\n  - tool names\n  - command text\n  - response and error text\n  - file paths\n  - token counts\n- Updated parser behavior to match the requested cases:\n  - lowercase `read` and `write` tool names now map to `FileRead` and `FileWrite`\n  - unknown JSON event types now return `None`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test` passed.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
